# Manual Directory Curated Photos

GeSY full-directory rebuild (2026-08): the previous curated finder photo roster was **intentionally removed**. Default gender/clinic avatars are used until new curated assets are added.

## How to add photos later

The maps-link photo map (`lib/finder-manual-photos.ts`) was removed in Point E5 (2026-10-01): it was empty, and listings no longer carry a Maps link of their own (it lives on their clinics). To bring curated photos back, key them by professional id (or upload an avatar) rather than by a Maps URL.
